+## Risks
+
+- The replay server may disconnect often. The consumer's backoff must keep the run inside `DURATION`. Phase 7 tests cover this.
+- Dedupe scans the committed `edits.parquet` files on each micro-batch. For one replayed hour this is acceptable. If it is slow, the plan moves the dedupe keys into the commit state (D7 names this as the fallback).
+- Dbt external writes on a re-run must replace the old mart file. Phase 6 checks this with the Phase 5 idempotency test.
+- Live Wikimedia behavior is not tested. Only the configured URL changes.
